  "notes": "This is a fail-closed evaluator-freeze hand-off for closed candidate dry runs, not a public activation. The FluidsBench evaluator implementation is committed at the immutable revision above, and the implementation manifest binds the cross-repository source bytes used by the candidate. Exact degree-one force, exact degree-two pitching moment, case-qRef normalization, and the independent byte-identical Full360 native prefreeze replay are complete. The final Full360 schema-v3 candidate was assembled independently twice, both packages passed candidate-dry-run validation, and both deterministic ZIP builds have the same SHA-256; this closes only the technical full_360_force_and_overall_replay_complete gate. The native evaluator Git revision, native container image digest, and native Python/site-package closure remain unresolved, and benchmark-owner approval is pending. This record does not publish hidden truth, activate the candidate, open submissions, upload or publish a package, or create a public or private leaderboard result."
